    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_i_archival_backend" kindref="compound">IArchivalBackend</ref></para>
<para>Pluggable backend interface for WAL segment storage. The default LocalArchivalBackend writes to the local filesystem; cloud backends (S3, GCS, Azure Blob) implement this interface for object-storage targets. </para>
